Additional continuation training (2026-10-22): reviewed public synthetic pinyin cases and fixed public general-text replay. The local CPU/FP32 stages use actual CLI candidate ranking, supervised target-suffix likelihood for representable missing targets, and ordinary text CE. Source hashes, original attribution and mixed/undeclared licensing remain in provenance.json. No private conversations, application text or system learning were used.

